+| Project | Probe result | Relevance |
+|---|---|---|
+| `mem0ai/mem0` | 67.8k★, Apache-2.0; PyPI `mem0ai 2.2.1` (`requires_python >=3.10`) | extraction → consolidation → retrieval pipeline for agent memory |
+| `getzep/graphiti` | 32.3k★, Apache-2.0, py≥3.10 | temporal context graphs: validity windows, provenance episodes, ontology — the shape `user_memories` grows into when facts change |
