+
+- **Realtime voice frameworks (Pipecat / LiveKit Agents)** — the voice plane is real and bn-BD-first
+  (`gateway/services/voice_service.py`: Groq Whisper STT + edge-tts/ElevenLabs; `websocket_voice.py` with
+  connection caps), but it is request/response + WS streaming with no observed failure of that model. A
+  full-duplex framework adoption without an observed failure is the same shape as radar VII's Temporal
+  hold-back. `MONITOR`.
+- **Agent orchestration frameworks (LangGraph 1.0 / Microsoft Agent Framework)** — the loop's single-dispatch
+  cron topology + `AGENT_LOOP_SPEC` SSOT + 30-min lease machinery just landed and works; re-platforming the
+  orchestration layer would be speculation without an observed coordination failure. Held back.
+- **Letta (MemGPT lineage)** — covered conceptually by R31's probe set (memory tiering); a separate filing
+  would duplicate #1747's lane. Referenced only.
+- **Exa as a search-supply lane** — live probe returned 404 on the assumed path; inconclusive evidence is no
+  evidence. Excluded from R32 rather than filed on hope.
+- **Self-hosted SearXNG** — public instances disable the JSON API (200-but-HTML) or rate-limit hard (429);
+  a self-hosted deployment is a new ops burden with no observed demand signal today. Held back inside R32's
+  never-do scope.
